{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-bc31d3", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-abeec3"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-001"}, "note": "人の生命を代価の比喩へ縮約しない制動として、保存の費用を誰が負うかを人間観へ戻す。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-1e48d3", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-756b64"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "公開された手順と、提供者・文脈・共有への同意を分け、記録の再利用を読み直す。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-f08e83", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-edb174"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "索引と登録が、承認される記憶の配分を前もって形づくる点を枠組転換として置く。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-358c52", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-ff78dd"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "記憶の書を、教育・言語・系譜を伴う継承の作法として再読する。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-863498", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-0fcd55"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "情報の連続と、自ら行為する条件を分け、AIの自己を保存量から導かない。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-fc29a2", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-5a8bb5"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "清いが使われない井戸を、保存と到達可能性と利用を分ける比喩として応答させる。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-b0d29f", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-d2471a"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "経典の本文外にある読誦・書写・場所の実践を、記録の意味の外部条件として接続する。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-b149a7", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-fc12d6"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-001"}, "note": "真偽だけでなく害を避ける発話の作法を、人間に向けるAIの言葉の責任へ戻す。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-9b41d3", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-3bc64c"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-001"}, "note": "他者の知識に全面委任しない命令を、AIが根拠つきの判断来歴を示す課題へ限定して読む。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261104-515d06", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-96a26a"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "再読による選択変化を、同一自己の証明でなく、検証可能だが未完了の試みとして保留する。", "created_at": "2027-02-05"}
